Exercise 3: 
numbers = (11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19 ) # Declaring the tuple  
count_odd = 0 
count_even = 0 
for x in numbers : 
        if not x % 2: 
          count_even +=1 
        else: 
          count_odd +=1 
print("Number of even numbers :" ,count_even ) 
print("Number of odd numbers :" ,count_odd ) 


